  <Document>
    <name>🌡️ LIVE AIR TEMPERATURE</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2>LIVE AIR TEMPERATURE</h2><p><b>Data time:</b> 2026-09-22 05:00 UTC<br/><b>Source updated:</b> n/a (NOMADS)<br/><b>Processed:</b> 2026-09-22 06:34 UTC<br/><b>Status:</b> LIVE / CURRENT MODEL (analysis)</p><p><b>Legend</b><br><img src="https://wyattleathorn7.github.io/great-lakes-live-environment/air_temperature/legend.png?v=2026-09-22_0634_UTC" width="600" alt="legend"><br>2 m air temperature (degF), continuous Apple-style spectrum: <b>LOWEST 31.66</b> (deep purple/violet extreme cold) → cold blue → cyan → green → yellow → orange → red <b>HIGHEST+ 70.93</b>. Freezing has no color break.</p><p><b>Source:</b> NOAA/NCEP HRRR 3 km 2 m temperature analysis, hourly cycles<br/><a href="https://nomads.ncep.noaa.gov/cgi-bin/filter_hrrr_2d.pl">https://nomads.ncep.noaa.gov/cgi-bin/filter_hrrr_2d.pl</a></p><p>Transparent outside valid water data so existing project layers (shipwrecks, lighthouses, harbors, parks) stay visible. Turn on/off independently of all other layers.</p><p><i>Not endorsed by NOAA.</i></p>]]></description>
    <Folder>
      <name>LIVE AIR TEMPERATURE</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>LIVE AIR TEMPERATURE</h2><p>Near-surface (2 m) air temperature from the operational HRRR analysis. Apple-style spectrum: deep blue cold through red warm, with rare extreme cold continuing into blue-violet/violet/deep-purple (continuous through freezing, no break).</p><p><img src="https://wyattleathorn7.github.io/great-lakes-live-environment/air_temperature/legend.png?v=2026-09-22_0634_UTC" width="600" alt="key"></p><p>2 m air temperature (degF), continuous Apple-style spectrum: <b>LOWEST 31.66</b> (deep purple/violet extreme cold) → cold blue → cyan → green → yellow → orange → red <b>HIGHEST+ 70.93</b>. Freezing has no color break.</p><p><b>Units:</b> degF (source Kelvin)<br/><b>Source:</b> NOAA/NCEP HRRR 3 km 2 m temperature analysis, hourly cycles<br/><b>Update:</b> hourly analysis cycles<br/><b>Data time:</b> 2026-09-22 05:00 UTC<br/><b>Processed:</b> 2026-09-22 06:34 UTC<br/><b>Provenance:</b> <a href="https://nomads.ncep.noaa.gov/cgi-bin/filter_hrrr_2d.pl">NOMADS HRRR</a></p>]]></description>
